 Max Pooling 2D, shape (batch_size, channels, pooled_height, pooled_width).\n        \"\"\"\n        return self.maxpool(x)\n\nbatch_size = 32\nchannels = 64\nheight = 512\nwidth = 512\nkernel_size = 4\nstride = 1\npadding = 1\ndilation = 1\n\ndef get_inputs():\n    x = torch.rand(batch_size, channels, height, width)\n    return [x]\n\ndef get_init_inputs():\n    return [kernel_size, stride, padding, dilation]\n\n```\n",
